/E (RESEARCH QUESTIONS 1. How does legal language construct authority and generate obedience or compliance in different legal contexts? 2. What role do metaphors and rhetorical devices play in reinforcing or challenging conformity and dissent within legal discourse? 3. In what ways do multilingual environments affect the clarity, interpretation, and accessibility of legal texts and proceedings? 4. How do linguistic practices in law reproduce or challenge social inequalities linked to class, gender, or minority identity?)
